{"id":2317,"date":"2025-06-10T11:25:26","date_gmt":"2025-06-10T16:25:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=2317"},"modified":"2025-06-10T11:37:41","modified_gmt":"2025-06-10T16:37:41","slug":"arkham-horror-rpg-the-believer-the-adventurer","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/arkham-horror-rpg-the-believer-the-adventurer\/","title":{"rendered":"Arkham Horror RPG: The Believer &amp; The Adventurer"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Free RPG Day is coming on June 21, when you&#8217;ll be able to pick up a copy of the quickstart adventure <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/free-rpg-day-is-coming\/\"><em>Comets of Kingsport <\/em>for <em>Arkham Horror<\/em><\/a><em>: The Roleplaying Game<\/em>, and in the build-up we have some exclusive new content for you in the shape of eight pre-generated characters ready to use in your games. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In <em>Arkham Horror: The Roleplaying Game<\/em>, players create their characters around one of eight Archetypes, each embodying some of the different personalities to be found among those motivated to become Investigators. Each of these Archetypes is accompanied by a stunning illustration and to mark Free RPG Day, the teams at EDGE Studio and Aconyte Books have collaborated to bring each of these illustrations to life as a ready-made Investigator, complete with profile and story so far.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Today, you can download the first two of these new Investigators \u2013&nbsp;Albert Haskins, the Believer, and Farah Hashim, the Adventurer. Check out these two Investigators below, and we&#8217;ll be bringing you the remaining six Archetypes between now and Free RPG Day. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"h-albert-haskins-the-believer\">Albert Haskins, The Believer<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure cl